{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_opencode_opencode", "label": "Compatibilidad con opencode", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": "L1-L116", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_opencode_sync_opencode_js", "label": "`sync-opencode.js` como traductor unidireccional", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La fuente de verdad sigue siendo .claude/: el script traduce a .opencode/command, .opencode/agent, .opencode/plugin y la clave mcp, nunca al rev\u00e9s."}, {"id": "docs_opencode_provider_pinning", "label": "Un `model:` fijado en un subagente gana sobre el `--model` de sesi\u00f3n", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verificado con logs: el subagente pinneado intent\u00f3 su propio provider y fall\u00f3 por cr\u00e9dito, y el agente primario absorbi\u00f3 el fallo devolviendo 'ok.' sin exponer el error \u2014 para cambiar toda la flota hay que regenerar con --provider."}, {"id": "docs_opencode_tools_to_permission_heuristic", "label": "Heur\u00edstica tools \u2192 permission", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "opencode controla permisos por categor\u00eda, no por herramienta: la traducci\u00f3n preserva la intenci\u00f3n (un agente de solo lectura sigue si\u00e9ndolo), no replica la lista 1:1."}, {"id": "docs_opencode_subagent_invocation_fallback", "label": "Fallback silencioso de `--agent` con subagentes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "opencode avisa y ejecuta con el agente `build` de permisos completos: parece que el agente de solo lectura permiti\u00f3 escribir, cuando en realidad ni se us\u00f3."}, {"id": "docs_opencode_hooks_to_plugins", "label": "Hooks de Claude Code \u2192 plugins de opencode", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "tool.execute.before mapea PreToolUse con alta confianza, pero SessionStart solo tiene el equivalente experimental.chat.system.transform, deduplicado a mano con un Set por sessionID."}, {"id": "docs_opencode_mcp_command_array", "label": "Esquema `command` como array \u00fanico en opencode", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La primera versi\u00f3n generaba command+args por separado y opencode lo ignoraba en silencio; se detect\u00f3 comparando contra el JSON Schema publicado, no adivinando."}, {"id": "docs_opencode_claude_md_native_fallback", "label": "`CLAUDE.md` le\u00eddo nativamente por opencode", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "opencode cae de vuelta a CLAUDE.md cuando no hay AGENTS.md, as\u00ed que la doctrina de NEPTUNO no se duplica."}, {"id": "docs_opencode_duplicate_plugin_loading", "label": "Carga duplicada de plugins proyecto+global", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dentro de NEPTUNO se cargan ambas copias del mismo plugin; para protect-secrets es inofensivo pero los dos de contexto se inyectar\u00edan duplicados, y opencode no ofrece hoy forma de excluir la copia global."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_opencode_opencode", "target": "docs_opencode_sync_opencode_js", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_opencode_opencode", "target": "docs_opencode_provider_pinning", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_opencode_opencode", "target": "docs_opencode_tools_to_permission_heuristic", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_opencode_opencode", "target": "docs_opencode_subagent_invocation_fallback", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_opencode_opencode", "target": "docs_opencode_hooks_to_plugins", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_opencode_opencode", "target": "docs_opencode_mcp_command_array", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_opencode_opencode", "target": "docs_opencode_claude_md_native_fallback", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_opencode_opencode", "target": "docs_opencode_duplicate_plugin_loading", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/OPENCODE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_opencode_hooks_to_plugins", "target": "docs